SUMMARY:Bus Hike: Terra Cotta (New Hikers/Families Welcome)
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Bruce Trail Club\nNew Hikers (but all are welcome) are
  invited to join me on a 10 km Introductory Level Bus Hike on the Toronto 
 Section of the Bruce Trail around Terra Cotta less than an hour from Toron
 to. Expect some downhill/uphill and tree roots but nothing too rocky or ch
 allenging. We'll be following behind the hikers completing the club's annu
 al two day E2E hike. There will be the option of a short out and back hike
  on the Walking Fern Side Trail at the end. After the hike we'll drive to 
 Spirit Tree Estates Cidery that offers pizza and baked goods and a country
  store. Hopefully the weather cooperates so we can sit on the picnic table
 s outside. Optional dropout at 5 km. Hiking boots are recommended. Beginne
 rs and families welcome.\n\n\\*\\* Registration opens Sun Aug 30 at 8:00 P
 M. You must register and prepay the bus fare on the Bruce Trail Conservanc
 y Website $25 Members/$32 Non-Member Children Under 10 $12/$14 (bus fares 
 are non-refundable and the hike goes rain or shine)\n\nRegistration link:\
 n[https://hikes.brucetrail.org/event/bus-hike-terra-cotta-new-hikers-famil
 ies-welcome/2026-09-12/](https://hikes.brucetrail.org/event/bus-hike-terra
 -cotta-new-hikers-families-welcome/2026-09-12/)
